 3→// Routes:
 4→//   GET  /perception/frame   -> latest perception packet (JSON + base64 image)
 5→//   GET  /perception/status  -> capture state, fps, buffer stats
 6→//   PUT  /perception/config  -> set resolution, format, rate
 7→//   PUT  /perception/start   -> begin capturing
 8→//   PUT  /perception/stop    -> stop capturing
 9→//   PUT  /perception/single  -> one-shot capture
